{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\n  \"quantitative_comparisons\": [\n    {\n      \"research_object\": \"MITRIC trial (P0578)\",\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR: 0%; Median PFS: 1.5 months; Clinical benefit (SD >6mo): 1/12 patients\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Phase IIa single-arm basket trial, ICI-refractory advanced solid tumors (melanoma, HNSCC, RCC, MSI-H pancreatic cancer)\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"Total (n=12)\",\n          \"value\": \"ORR 0%, Median PFS 1.5 mo\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"research_object\": \"TACITO trial (P0593)\",\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"12-month PFS rate: 70% vs 41% (P=0.053); Median PFS: 24.0 vs 9.0 months (HR=0.50, P=0.035); Median OS: 41.0 vs 28.3 months (P=0.167)\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Phase 2a randomized double-blind placebo-controlled trial, treatment-naive metastatic RCC (pembrolizumab + axitinib)\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"Donor FMT (d-FMT) (n=23 approx based on total 45)\",\n          \"value\": \"12-mo PFS 70%, Median PFS 24.0 mo, Median OS 41.0 mo\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"group\": \"Placebo FMT (p-FMT) (n=22 approx based on total 45)\",\n          \"value\": \"12-mo PFS 41%, Median PFS 9.0 mo, Median OS 28.3 mo\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"research_object\": \"Kim et al. (P0594)\",\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR: 7.7%; DCR: 46.2%\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Prospective single-arm single-center study, anti-PD-1 refractory advanced solid cancers (gastric, esophageal, HCC)\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"Total (n=13)\",\n          \"value\": \"ORR 7.7%, DCR 46.2%\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"usable_content\": \"现有文献中尚未发现已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在实体瘤中的疗效。目前最高级别的证据来自 Phase IIa 阶段的随机对照试验和单臂研究，结果呈现异质性且未达成最终确证。\\n\\n具体而言，TACITO 试验是一项针对转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）一线治疗患者的 Phase 2a 随机双盲安慰剂对照试验。虽然其次要终点中位无进展生存期（PFS）显著延长（24.0个月 vs 9.0个月，HR=0.50, P=0.035），但主要终点 12 个月 PFS 率未达到统计学显著差异（70% vs 41%, P=0.053），且总生存期（OS）虽呈有利趋势但未达显著性（P=0.167）。这表明在特定癌种和一线治疗背景下，FMT 显示出潜在的临床活性信号，但尚不足以作为确证性证据。\\n\\n相比之下，MITRIC 试验是一项针对多种晚期实体瘤（包括黑色素瘤、头颈鳞癌等）ICI 耐药患者的单臂 Phase IIa 篮式试验。该研究结果显示 FMT 安全性良好，但临床疗效有限：客观缓解率（ORR）为 0%，中位 PFS 仅为 1.5 个月，仅 1 名患者获得长期疾病稳定。机制分析提示，这种疗效局限可能与供体菌群定植短暂、宿主基线免疫环境（如髓系优势、高 IL-8）反映的是疾病状态而非 FMT 的直接作用有关。\\n\\n此外，Kim 等人（2024）发表的一项前瞻性单臂研究显示，在抗 PD-1 耐药的晚期实体瘤中，FMT 联合抗 PD-1 治疗可获得 7.7% 的 ORR 和 46.2% 的疾病控制率，并鉴定出特定的有益菌株（Prevotella merdae Immunoactis）。然而，由于缺乏随机对照设计和较大的样本量，这属于概念验证性质的探索性数据。\\n\\n综上所述，尽管有 Phase 2a RCT 显示部分指标改善，也有单臂研究提供机制支持，但目前缺乏大型 III 期 RCT 来确证 FMT 在广泛实体瘤人群中的确切疗效和生存获益。现有的阴性或混合结果提示疗效高度依赖于癌症类型、治疗线数（一线 vs 耐药）、供体选择及宿主免疫背景。\",\n  \"decision\": \"external_research\",\n  \"answers_requested_question\": false,\n  \"still_missing\": \"需要检索并确认是否存在已完成的、针对 FMT 或定义明确的微生物联合体在实体瘤（特别是黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌等）中的大型 Phase III 随机对照试验（RCT）及其结果。目前的材料仅包含 Phase IIa 试验（TACITO, MITRIC）和单臂研究（Kim et al.），均不满足 'Phase III RCT' 的成功标准。\",\n  \"read_focus\": \"重点检索 2024-2025 年间发表的关于 FMT 在肿瘤免疫治疗中的 Phase III 临床试验注册信息或已发表结果。特别关注 TACITO 试验是否有后续 Phase III 扩展，以及是否有其他大型多中心 RCT 完成。\",\n  \"external_ask\": \"请检索并列出所有已完成的、评估 FMT 或特定微生物制剂在实体瘤中与免疫检查点抑制剂联合使用的 Phase III 随机对照试验。需提供试验名称、注册号、主要终点结果及是否达到统计学显著性。若不存在此类试验，请明确说明截至当前日期的证据等级仅限于 Phase II 阶段。\",\n  \"reason\": \"提供的材料中，P0578 (MITRIC) 是单臂 Phase IIa 试验，结果为阴性/有限；P0593 (TACITO) 是 Phase 2a RCT，主要终点未达标，次要终点显著，但不是 Phase III；P0594 (Kim et al.) 是单臂前瞻性研究。所有材料均未提供 'completed large-scale Phase III RCT' 的证据。根据 success_criteria，必须找到符合条件的实例才能回答，因此判定为 external_research。\"\n}","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    *   **Role/Task:** Review author's material reading assistant. Extract specific research insights around a writing question.\n    *   **Input Materials:** `material_found` (4 items: P0578, P0593, P0594), `paper_context` (summaries of the same papers).\n    *   **Question:** \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\" (Has a completed large-scale randomized controlled Phase III clinical trial confirmed the efficacy of microbiome interventions (e.g., FMT) in treating solid tumors with ICIs?)\n    *   **User Scope:** \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\" (This is the broader context, but the specific question is about Phase III RCTs confirming efficacy.)\n    *   **Success Criteria:** \"return directly relevant evidence or state why the gap remains unresolved.\"\n    *   **Constraints:** Follow strict output format (JSON with specific fields: quantitative_comparisons, usable_content, decision, answers_requested_question, still_missing, read_focus, external_ask, reason). Handle numbers carefully. Distinguish between different studies/settings. Do not overgeneralize. Decision must be based on whether the *specific question* is answered.\n\n2.  **Evaluate Materials against Question:**\n    *   *Question Focus:* Completed, large-scale, Phase III, Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT) confirming efficacy of microbiome intervention (FMT) in solid tumors + ICI.\n    *   *Material P0578 (MITRIC trial):* Single-arm phase IIa basket trial. n=12. ORR 0%. Not Phase III, not randomized. Explicitly states it doesn't meet the criterion.\n    *   *Material P0593 (TACITO trial):* Investigator-initiated, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled **phase 2a** trial. Published 2025. n=45. Primary endpoint (12-month PFS rate) not met (P=0.053). Secondary endpoint (median PFS) significantly improved (24.0 vs 9.0 months, HR=0.50, P=0.035). OS trend favorable but not significant (P=0.167). Explicitly states it's Phase 2a, not Phase III.\n    *   *Material P0594 (Kim et al.):* Prospective, single-arm, single-center study. n=13. Not an RCT, not Phase III. Provides mechanistic insights (P. merdae Immunoactis).\n    *   *Conclusion from Materials:* None of the provided materials report a completed Phase III RCT. They explicitly describe Phase IIa trials (MITRIC, TACITO) or single-arm prospective studies. The question asks for confirmation of Phase III RCTs. The materials clearly state this level of evidence is currently lacking/unmet.\n\n3.  **Extract Quantitative Comparisons (if any):**\n    *   Need to list them strictly as requested: `research_object`, `result_or_measure`, `setting_or_time`, `groups`.\n    *   From P0593 (TACITO):\n        *   Research object: mRCC patients receiving pembrolizumab + axitinib\n        *   Result/measure: Median PFS\n        *   Setting/time: Phase 2a RCT, post-randomization follow-up\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"24.0 months\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"9.0 months\"}]\n        *   Stats: HR = 0.50, P = 0.035\n    *   From P0593 (TACITO):\n        *   Result/measure: 12-month PFS rate\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"70%\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"41%\"}]\n        *   Stats: P = 0.053\n    *   From P0593 (TACITO):\n        *   Result/measure: Median OS\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"41.0 months\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"28.3 months\"}]\n        *   Stats: P = 0.167\n    *   From P0578 (MITRIC):\n        *   Result/measure: ORR / Clinical benefit\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"Overall cohort\", value: \"ORR 0%; clinical benefit in 1/12 patient\"}]\n        *   Stats: N/A\n    *   I will format these strictly according to the prompt's structure. Note: The prompt says \"一组一数成对，不用多组名字对应一串数字\". I'll list each metric separately.\n\n4.  **Draft Usable Content:**\n    *   Must address the question directly: No completed Phase III RCTs have been reported in the current literature base. The available evidence consists of early-phase trials (Phase IIa).\n    *   Highlight differences/findings from the provided materials: MITRIC (single-arm, ICI-refractory, n=12) showed safety but no objective responses (ORR 0%). TACITO (randomized, placebo-controlled, first-line mRCC, n=45) was a Phase 2a trial where the primary endpoint (12-month PFS rate) missed statistical significance (70% vs 41%, P=0.053), though median PFS was significantly prolonged (24.0 vs 9.0 months, HR=0.50, P=0.035). OS showed a non-significant trend. Kim et al. (single-arm, refractory solid tumors, n=13) reported modest clinical activity (ORR 7.7%) and identified strain-specific mechanisms (e.g., *P. merdae* Immunoactis enhancing CD8+ T cell response), but lacked control groups.\n    *   Explain conditions/context: Efficacy appears highly context-dependent (treatment-naïve vs. refractory, cancer type, donor selection, engraftment durability). Current data stops at Phase IIa/single-arm levels; definitive survival benefits require larger, later-phase randomized validation.\n    *   Ensure tone matches requirements: Direct, precise, no overgeneralization, preserves distinctions.\n\n5.  **Determine Decision & Fields:**\n    *   `decision`: `external_research`? Wait, the question asks \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验...\". The materials explicitly state none exist yet (only Phase IIa). Does this answer the question? Yes, it directly answers that such trials are currently unmet/lacking based on the provided scope, and explains the current stage (Phase IIa). However, the prompt says: \"对于“是否已经有某类研究/结果”的问题，找到一个符合条件的实例可以回答；几篇论文未提到，或一篇较早综述说当时没有，不能回答当前是否存在。已有内容可以说明截至该来源时间的研究格局；若仍需确认后来是否出现目标研究，就选择 external_research 并提出该项具体检索，不要一边宣布问题已解决一边仍要求确认其核心答案。只有问题明确限定在这些来源的时间或材料范围内，才可据此直接给出否定答案。\"\n    *   The question doesn't specify a time cutoff, but the materials are recent (2024-2025). I should state that within the current evidence landscape, only Phase IIa trials exist, and confirm that no Phase III RCTs have been published to date. Given the strict instruction, I will mark `decision` as `direct_use` because the materials explicitly address the trial phase status and conclude that Phase III confirmation is pending/unmet, which directly answers the existence question for the current literature. Alternatively, `external_research` if I need to search beyond these papers. But the prompt says \"只有问题明确限定在这些来源的时间或材料范围内，才可据此直接给出否定答案。\" The question is general. I'll stick to `direct_use` but note the limitation, or use `external_research` to suggest verifying latest publications post-2025. Actually, the materials themselves say \"no Phase III RCTs have yet confirmed efficacy\". I will use `direct_use` as the core answer is present: currently only Phase IIa/single-arm evidence exists, Phase III is unmet. I'll set `answers_requested_question` to `true` because it directly addresses the phase/status query with explicit negative findings from the sources.\n    *   Wait, let's re-read carefully: \"decision 判断当前具体问题是否解决，而不是材料有没有用：direct_use=足以回答当前问题... external_research=缺新的研究对象、方法、比较或验证材料\". Since the question asks for Phase III RCTs, and the materials explicitly state they don't exist yet (only Phase IIa), this directly answers the question. I'll go with `direct_use`.\n    *   `answers_requested_question`: true\n    *   `still_missing`: 暂无后续更新的III期试验注册或发表数据；需关注TACITO等IIa期试验的长期随访及后续III期设计进展。\n    *   `read_focus`: 无（当前材料已明确界定研究阶段为IIa期，直接回应了关于III期试验存在的提问）。\n    *   `external_ask`: 建议检索2025年后是否新注册或完成针对FMT联合ICI的III期RCT（如特定癌种或菌株定植产品的确证性试验），以更新证据等级。\n    *   `reason`: 提供的材料均明确标注为单臂IIa期或随机双盲IIa期试验（MITRIC与TACITO），并直接指出目前尚无III期RCT证实疗效。材料已完整覆盖“是否存在”的判断依据与当前证据阶段，故可直接作答。\n\n6.  **Refine Output Structure (Mental Walkthrough & JSON Construction):**\n    *   Check `quantitative_comparisons` format: array of objects with `research_object`, `result_or_measure`, `setting_or_time`, `groups`. `groups` is array of `{group, value}`.\n    *   I will extract exactly as requested.\n    *   P0593 TACITO:\n        *   Obj: 转移性肾细胞癌(mRCC)患者接受帕博利珠单抗+阿昔替尼一线治疗\n        *   Measure: 中位无进展生存期(median PFS)\n        *   Setting: 随机双盲安慰剂对照IIa期试验(TACITO)随访期\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"24.0个月\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"9.0个月\"}]\n        *   Stats: HR=0.50, P=0.035\n        *   Obj: 12个月无进展生存率(12-month PFS rate)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"70%\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"41%\"}]\n        *   Stats: P=0.053\n        *   Obj: 中位总生存期(median OS)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"d-FMT\", value: \"41.0个月\"}, {group: \"p-FMT\", value: \"28.3个月\"}]\n        *   Stats: P=0.167\n    *   P0578 MITRIC:\n        *   Obj: ICI难治性晚期实体瘤患者(n=12)接受供者ICI应答者FMT联合ICI\n        *   Measure: 客观缓解率(ORR)与临床获益\n        *   Setting: 单臂IIa期篮式试验(MITRIC)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"总体队列\", value: \"ORR 0%；仅1例获得>6个月疾病稳定(Clinical benefit)\"}]\n        *   Stats: 无\n    *   P0594 Kim et al.:\n        *   Obj: 抗PD-1难治性晚期实体瘤患者(n=13)接受FMT联合抗PD-1\n        *   Measure: 客观缓解率(ORR)与疾病控制率(DCR)\n        *   Setting: 前瞻性单臂单中心研究\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"总体队列\", value: \"ORR 7.7%；DCR 46.2%\"}]\n        *   Stats: 无\n    *   I will format these carefully.\n    *   `usable_content`: Will synthesize the findings, emphasizing the lack of Phase III data, contrasting the Phase IIa results (TACITO's mixed endpoints, MITRIC's null result in refractory setting, Kim's single-arm proof-of-concept), and explaining the contextual factors (engraftment durability, immune milieu, donor matching, treatment line).\n    *   Check constraints: \"先呈现能区别不同研究的发现或论证，不先套领域常见结论；结尾也要保留这些区别。别把多个不同对象、材料、产品、场景或实验设置的结果合成一个普适机制或结论。\" -> I will structure it to highlight each trial's specific design, population, and outcome, then conclude on the Phase III status.\n    *   \"涉及数字时，先逐项输出 quantitative_comparisons... usable_content 解释含义，不重复重排数字。\" -> I will keep numbers out of usable_content or refer to them conceptually.\n    *   \"decision... answers_requested_question(boolean)\" -> Set accordingly.\n    *   All good. Proceed to generate JSON. \n    *   Self-Correction/Verification during thought:\n        *   Check `quantitative_comparisons` format requirement: `groups 是 [{group:原文组名或缩写,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]`. I'll ensure exact match.\n        *   Check `reported_statistics`: I'll add it to each item or as a separate field? The prompt says \"reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）\". I'll include it in each comparison object.\n        *   Let's construct carefully.\n        *   Structure:\n          ```json\n          {\n            \"quantitative_comparisons\": [ ... ],\n            \"usable_content\": \"...\",\n            \"decision\": \"direct_use\",\n            \"answers_requested_question\": true,\n            \"still_missing\": \"...\",\n            \"read_focus\": \"...\",\n            \"external_ask\": \"...\",\n            \"reason\": \"...\"\n          }\n          ```\n        *   I will draft the content now. \n        *   `quantitative_comparisons` items:\n          1. research_object: \"转移性肾细胞癌(mRCC)患者接受帕博利珠单抗联合阿昔替尼一线治疗\", result_or_measure: \"中位无进展生存期(median PFS)\", setting_or_time: \"随机双盲安慰剂对照IIa期试验(TACITO)随访期\", groups: [{\"group\":\"d-FMT\",\"value\":\"24.0个月\"},{\"group\":\"p-FMT\",\"value\":\"9.0个月\"}], reported_statistics: \"HR=0.50, P=0.035\"\n          2. research_object: \"同上\", result_or_measure: \"12个月无进展生存率(12-month PFS rate)\", setting_or_time: \"同上\", groups: [{\"group\":\"d-FMT\",\"value\":\"70%\"},{\"group\":\"p-FMT\",\"value\":\"41%\"}], reported_statistics: \"P=0.053\"\n          3. research_object: \"同上\", result_or_measure: \"中位总生存期(median OS)\", setting_or_time: \"同上\", groups: [{\"group\":\"d-FMT\",\"value\":\"41.0个月\"},{\"group\":\"p-FMT\",\"value\":\"28.3个月\"}], reported_statistics: \"P=0.167\"\n          4. research_object: \"ICI难治性晚期实体瘤患者(n=12)接受供者ICI应答者FMT联合ICI\", result_or_measure: \"客观缓解率(ORR)与临床获益\", setting_or_time: \"单臂IIa期篮式试验(MITRIC)\", groups: [{\"group\":\"总体队列\",\"value\":\"ORR 0%；仅1例获>6个月疾病稳定\"}], reported_statistics: \"无\"\n          5. research_object: \"抗PD-1难治性晚期实体瘤患者(n=13)接受FMT联合抗PD-1\", result_or_measure: \"客观缓解率(ORR)与疾病控制率(DCR)\", setting_or_time: \"前瞻性单臂单中心研究(Kim等)\", groups: [{\"group\":\"总体队列\",\"value\":\"ORR 7.7%；DCR 46.2%\"}], reported_statistics: \"无\"\n        *   `usable_content`: 聚焦于“是否存在III期RCT”的直接回答。明确指出当前证据止步于IIa期/单臂探索阶段，尚未有大型III期RCT确证疗效。分述各研究差异：MITRIC针对ICI难治性多癌种单臂队列显示安全性可接受但无客观缓解；TACITO作为首个随机双盲安慰剂对照IIa试验，在mRCC一线人群中主要终点（12个月PFS率）未达统计学显著，次要终点（中位PFS）显著延长，OS呈有利趋势但未达显著；Kim等单臂研究提示特定菌株（如P. merdae Immunoactis）可能通过增强CD8+ T细胞反应发挥抗肿瘤作用，但缺乏对照且样本量小。综合表明，FMT疗效高度依赖治疗线数（初治vs难治）、宿主免疫微环境基线状态、供体匹配度及菌群定植持久性。现有数据仅能提供机制假说与早期信号，无法替代大规模随机对照的确证性证据。\n        *   Matches all constraints. Ready. \n        *   One minor check: The prompt says \"reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）\". I'll put it as a string in each object.\n        *   All good. Output matches request. \n        *   Generate. \n        *   Self-Correction/Note during generation prep: The prompt says \"groups 是 [{group:原文组名或缩写,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]\". I will strictly follow this. I'll make sure the JSON is valid.\n        *   I will produce the exact JSON","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791139150,"id":"chatcmpl-d8c1cd43-67d4-9dd2-83cf-a2fb58f9618f","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":5621,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":4096,"text_tokens":5621},"prompt_tokens":7723,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":7723},"total_tokens":13344}}